ator.prototype.join` converts yielded values to strings and concatenates them with a separator."},"1032":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-6","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#what-it-does","content":"The method consumes its receiver without first collecting the values into an array. The default separator is a comma. `null` and `undefined` values contribute empty strings, matching the corresponding array operation."},"1033":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-7","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#gotchas","content":"The receiver is exhausted even though no array is allocated. If converting the separator or an element to a string throws, the method closes the underlying iterator."},"1034":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-8","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"TC39 active proposals at the cutoff"},"1035":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-9","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"TC39 stage record, published 2026-07-22, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1036":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-10","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"Iterator Join § proposal"},"1037":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-11","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"TC39 proposal repository, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1038":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-12","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"TC39 notes: Iterator Join"},"1039":{"id":"/features/iterator-join-13","page_id":"/features/iterator-join","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-join#sources","content":"Committee notes, published 2026-05-20, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1040":{"id":"/features/