":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#what-it-does","content":"`Iterator.zip` takes an iterable of iterables and yields arrays. `Iterator.zipKeyed` takes an object of iterables and yields objects with the same keys. Their `mode` option stops at the shortest input, pads to the longest input, or requires equal lengths."},"1051":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-8","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#gotchas","content":"The default mode stops when the first input finishes and closes unfinished iterators. Longest mode takes per-input padding values; strict mode throws when lengths differ."},"1052":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-9","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#related","content":"iterator-helpers"},"1053":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-10","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#related","content":"iterator-concat"},"1054":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-11","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#sources","content":"Joint Iteration proposal § proposal"},"1055":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-12","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#sources","content":"TC39 proposal repository, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1056":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-13","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#sources","content":"Joint Iteration proposal § considered-design-space"},"1057":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-14","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#sources","content":"TC39 proposal repository, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1058":{"id":"/features/iterator-zip-15","page_id":"/features/iterator-zip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/iterator-zip#sources","content":"TC39 finished proposals at the cutoff"},"1059":{"id":"/features/iterator-