"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#mathsumprecise","content":"`Math.sumPrecise` returns the correctly rounded sum of an iterable of Number values."},"1198":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-6","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#what-it-does","content":"The operation accumulates as though using exact arithmetic and then converts the result to a Number, avoiding order-sensitive loss from repeated binary64 addition. It accepts an iterable rather than variadic arguments and rejects non-Number elements."},"1199":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-7","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#gotchas","content":"An empty iterable produces negative zero, the floating-point additive identity used by the algorithm. BigInt values are not accepted."},"1200":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-8","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#sources","content":"Math.sumPrecise proposal § questions"},"1201":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-9","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#sources","content":"TC39 proposal repository, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1202":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-10","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#sources","content":"Math.sumPrecise proposal § is-the-sum-of-an-empty-list-0-or--0"},"1203":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-11","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#sources","content":"TC39 proposal repository, reviewed 2026-07-23"},"1204":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise-12","page_id":"/features/math-sum-precise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/features/math-sum-precise#sources","content":"ECMAScript 2026: Math.sumPrecise"},"1205":{"id":"/features/math-sum-precise